  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3} & 1 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3} & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((0)(-3)-(1)(2))i-((\\frac{2}{3})(-3)-(1)(1))j+((\\frac{2}{3})(2)-(0)(1))k \\\\  & =(0-2)i-(-2-1)j+(\\frac{4}{3})k \\\\  & =-2i+3j+(\\frac{4}{3})k \\\\  & =\u27e8-2,3,\\frac{4}{3}\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
